{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "latam", "appid": 548430, "month": "2021-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1615248000, "end_date": 1615852799, "month_true_total": 23, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:31:49 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "88382720", "author": {"steamid": "76561198837534094", "personaname": "Juanpy616", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/juanpy616/", "num_games_owned": 462, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 46008, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3, "playtime_at_review": 45881, "last_played": 1787415870, "avatar": "2833736f5d8ae1ee8466498e66a883409f78e07b"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Lo jugué un rato y estaba bueno.", "timestamp_created": 1615666362, "timestamp_updated": 1777612224, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88381882", "author": {"steamid": "76561197968715999", "personaname": "dogmeatt", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197968715999/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 1210, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 993, "last_played": 1617337058, "avatar": "b42dfe7babbeb8d47972fb86bc02c655974dfd21"}, "language": "latam", "review": "El juego está genial, pero lo recomiendo si vas a jugar con amigos on-line solamente.\nA veces es muy difícil encontrar las cosas y hay que recorrer todo el mapa una y otra vez hasta encontrar lo que falta. Si se pudiera identificar en el mapa [TAB] las zonas ya examinadas, sería perfecto.", "timestamp_created": 1615665289, "timestamp_updated": 1615665289, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88374301", "author": {"steamid": "76561198143709698", "personaname": "Kaku", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GaNaRoK/", "num_games_owned": 333, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 372, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 372, "last_played": 1583167716, "avatar": "34adcd2a2c63e40ce323f872f4781ef5ee322413"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Entetenido con amigos, aburrido solo", "timestamp_created": 1615656589, "timestamp_updated": 1615656589, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88318714", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072727156", "personaname": "Kokke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Kokkeoh/", "num_games_owned": 130, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 9132, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 616, "last_played": 1720313373, "avatar": "35734f3aa551ec378ac94fa6e909cd6f4da28a8a"}, "language": "latam", "review": "ESTE JUEGO ES MUUUY DIVERTIDO Y DESAFIANTE!\n\nJugarlo en Equipos (Co-Op):\nes un cagadero de risas. No he tenido ninguna misión en Equipos (ya sea con amigos o desconocidos) en la que no haya pasado un muy buen rato. Ademas, el trabajo en equipo vuelve tu participación vital para alcanzar el éxito en todas las tareas. \n\nJugarlo en Solitario:\nun desafío muy inmersivo. Tiene que cavar estratégicamente, mirar el mapa, planificar tu retorno a la nave con antelación y cuidar tus municiones. En especial en las dificultades nivel 3 o mas. \"Bosco\" será un Compañero infalible.\n\nEntorno:\nEste juego es un híbrido genialmente concebido entre Minecraft, FANTASY RPG y un Dungeoncrawler. Un estilo único y muy atractivo, con una banda sonora de lujo, customización del personaje y múltiples combinaciones de Builds de cada clase, todas entretenidas, a eso se suma la variedad de Biomas, mapas procedurales y diferentes misiones y objetivos, disparan la rejugabilidad a mil.\n\nDevelopers:\nActivisimos. Comprometidos con crear mas y mas contenido. no he visto un juego tener tantos Updates (de calidad) en tan poco tiempo desde su lanzamiento. el juego da para michas mas formas de juego y los cosméticos son muy bien recibidas por la comunidad.\nUn juego que vale la pena seguirle el paso.\n\nY TÚ ¿QUÉ OPINAS, EH?", "timestamp_created": 1615577880, "timestamp_updated": 1615577880, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88270614", "author": {"steamid": "76561198193814046", "personaname": "CALVO CON CAPA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198193814046/", "num_games_owned": 186, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 29710, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3596, "last_played": 1769706125, "avatar": "f7f4c31e52e515ef4df429dce7d63d0b1e0f1260"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Man I really hate those Bugs... except you Steeve, you're the best!", "timestamp_created": 1615506391, "timestamp_updated": 1653023799, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}